<title>BELGIUM: Fishler, Glickman to meet at FAO summit.</title>
<headline>Fishler, Glickman to meet at FAO summit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Farm Commissioner Franz Fischler and U.S. Agriculture Secretary Dan Glickman will meet to discuss bilateral issues on the margins of this month's World Food Summit in Rome, a Commission spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Although there was no official agenda for the meeting, the two were expected to discuss export refunds for cereals, genetically modified grains and veterinary agreements, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>It was not clear when the two would meet, but it would be either late on November 14 or on November 15, Fischler's office said. --Brussels newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
